  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">When you tap upon the flow of futures, you skip across time and space. When you use @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.BU3l8JfoPEij2idh]{Time Step}, you can Teleport up to 10 feet away. In addition, if you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Bcxarzksqt9ezrs6]{Stride} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.d5I6018Mci2SWokk]{Leap} 10 feet, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.HYNhdaPtF1QmQbR3]{Drop Prone} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.OdIUybJ3ddfL7wzj]{Stand}, you Teleport instead, avoiding reactions triggered by movement.</p>"
